WEBVTT

00:08:59.371 --> 00:09:03.537
And since then, you have gone on to
build more hospitals and schools,

00:09:03.537 --> 00:09:05.829
affordable housing, senior homes.

00:09:06.246 --> 00:09:10.787
And what's amazing to me is that you have
been thinking about architecture

00:09:10.787 --> 00:09:13.162
and airflow for over a decade.

00:09:13.746 --> 00:09:17.121
And I mean, the rest of us literally
just started thinking about this in

00:09:17.121 --> 00:09:18.287
the last few months.

00:09:18.287 --> 00:09:20.121
Yeah, I think we're you know,

00:09:20.121 --> 00:09:24.371
we're undergoing a real existential
moment in our relationship to

00:09:24.371 --> 00:09:26.996
the built environment around us,

00:09:26.996 --> 00:09:29.621
sort of recognizing that suddenly

00:09:29.621 --> 00:09:32.996
the built space around us could
really threaten us.